## Python packages

`pydrud pip add <package>` records a dependency in `pydrud.toml`; it does not
install packages into the host Python environment. Install declared packages
in the environment that runs `pydrud dev`. Package availability is therefore
controlled by that host environment, not by an APK build.

## Optional client features

Device services and widget types depend on what the connected renderer
advertises. Unsupported service calls fail immediately with an actionable
`Result` error, and widgets absent from an explicit `widget_types` catalogue
are displayed as visible text placeholders. `NativeView` is Android-specific
and remains unavailable unless the client explicitly advertises it.

